  "bodyHash": "3ee4d3c421daa1b8",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3b59b8cf5eb90045ef45a9c598d0364a9c7bf469.png\" alt=\"Excalibur | 清新動畫橫幅\"></p>\n<p><em>Fresh Animations（清新動畫），經典 Excalibur 氛圍。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0074de6e296ae110694b55ed238deffb36b96e9.png\" alt=\"載入順序\"> 載入順序</h2>\n<p>💡 <strong>為達到最佳相容性，建議的載入順序（由上至下）：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>Excalibur | Fresh Animations Patch</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Freshly Modded Lib</strong> <em>（選填，Freshly Modded (FMRP) 所需的函式庫）</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Freshly Modded Resource Pack (FMRP)</strong> – <em>（選填，用於支援 Guard Villagers 與 Friends&Foes）</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Fresh Animations</strong> (v1.10.3, <em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必裝</span></em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Excalibur Mod Support</strong> <em>（Curseforge/Modrinth 上提供的所有資源包，或 Excalibur 的 Discord 伺服器）</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Excalibur | Clarent Edition</strong> <em>（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必裝</span>）</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Excalibur</strong> <em>（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必裝</span>）</em></p></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a60f882e259dc6c0628f2f42f8b7eb0a12e99144.png\" alt=\"重要提示\"> <strong>重要提示：</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n  <li><strong>Clarent 必須直接載入於 Excalibur 之上。</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>其他附加包應載入於 Clarent 之上。</strong></li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a489900d9108e0b27130dcfb35769244ca565091.png\" alt=\"相容性\"> 相容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完整支援 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations v1.10.3</a></strong></li>\n<li>相容於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maffhew's Excalibur v1.21.10</a></strong></li>\n<li>相容於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clarent-excalibur-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur | Clarent 版</a></strong></li>\n<li>適用於 <strong>Minecraft 1.20.0 – 1.21.10</strong></li>\n<li>在提升寫實感與沉浸感的同時，保留 Excalibur 的視覺風格</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>需求</strong></h2>\n<p>使用此附加包需要：</p>\n<h3><strong>必要模組</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>OptiFine 或 ETF/EMF - <em>（OptiFine 目前存在錯誤，請自行承擔風險使用）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>必要資源包</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations v1.10.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur v1.21.10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clarent-excalibur-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur | Clarent 版</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>選填資源包</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/freshly-modded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">F.M.R.P v2.0.3</a> – 用於支援 Guard Villagers 與 Friends&amp;Foes</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組支援</strong></h3>\n<p>Excalibur | Fresh Animations 內建以下模組的支援：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Vanilla Backport</strong> <em>（您需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur-vanilla-backport-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur | 原版/銅時代回溯支援</a>）</em></li>\n<li><strong>Guard Villagers</strong> - 基於 TimothyWiggins 製作的材質 <em>（需要 FRMP，詳情請見下方）</em></li>\n<li><strong>Friends&Foes</strong> <em>（需要 FRMP，詳情請見下方）</em></li>\n<li>未來可能會考慮增加更多模組支援</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a60f882e259dc6c0628f2f42f8b7eb0a12e99144.png\" alt=\"重要提示\"> <em>模組支援程度可能因 Minecraft 版本與模組更新而略有差異。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8bbedc28a0884d735530759582d141796388f6c1.png\" alt=\"圓桌計畫\"> 關於圓桌計畫</h2>\n<p><strong>圓桌（The Round Table）</strong> 是一個以 <strong>Excalibur</strong> 為核心打造的資源包集合，由 <strong>GrandPappyJay</strong> 進一步擴展，提供更廣泛的版本相容性、更多視覺變體與細微的擴充內容——所有設計皆旨在忠於 Excalibur 世界的核心精神。</p>\n<h3>Minecraft 相容性</h3>\n<p><strong>1.20.0 – 1.20.1</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clarent: Clarent_215.4.a</li>\n<li>Echoes Through Time: <em>即將推出</em></li>\n<li>Fresh Animations Patch: EFA_215.4.a</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.20.2 – 1.21.5</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Clarent: Clarent_215.4.b</li>\n<li>Echoes Through Time: <em>即將推出</em></li>\n<li>Fresh Animations Patch: EFA_215.4.b</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><em>仔細聆聽……地平線彼端，迴響已然甦醒。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3410e04c261c28c37ab5a4504882383b93a43427.png\" alt=\"\"> 資源包版本編號說明</h2>\n<p>每個 Clarent 下載檔案皆遵循此結構：</p>\n<p><strong>[ Excalibur 版本（不含 1 ）] . [ 資源包建構號 ] . [ 支援變體 ]</strong></p>\n<p>範例：<br>\n<strong>Clarent_215.2.a.zip</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a850b4352ea2143a6b66f528118a6adb3c6294fd.png\" alt=\"社群支援\"> Excalibur 社群與致謝</h2>\n<h3><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/453606ca4b361cb344af3f82b0636cc06afbc8ef.png\" alt=\"邀請\"> 加入社群</h3>\n<p>發現錯誤需要回報？<br>\n有想法想要分享？<br>\n或是只想聊聊 Excalibur？</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qYZ9Pen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Excalibur 官方 Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d2bdbe237044aa18651d9cbf95f8c2eda5803cba.png\" alt=\"地圖\"> <em>冒險正在等候——每個聲音都能塑造這段旅程！</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/be985295c2a2d2c0613c75a0adedb9bad4b3b3b1.png\" alt=\"村民\"> 致謝名單</h3>\n<p>特別感謝讓此附加包得以實現的優秀創作者們：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maffhew</a></strong> – <em>Excalibur</em> 的創作者</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FreshLX</a></strong> – <em>Fresh Animations</em> 的創作者</li>\n<li><strong>TimothyWiggins127</strong> – Guard Villagers 材質素材</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/seb_semos/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SebSemos</a></strong> – <em>Freshly Modded 資源包 (FMRP)</em> 的創作者</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GrandPappyJay</a></strong> – <em>Excalibur Fresh Animations Patch</em> 的創作者與先驅</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ebbf723731a43e74defbc96665ae3f994561efc4.png\" alt=\"探索更多\"> 探索更多 Excalibur 創作</h3>\n<p>熱愛 Excalibur？探索更多受其世界啟發的創作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Maffhew</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fMaffhew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>GrandPappyJay</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fGrandPappyJay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>TeeCee</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTeeCee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>Ruseki_</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fRuseki_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ruseki/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>_Aetheris</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252f_Aetheris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;—</li>\n<li><strong>stradat</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fstradat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;—</li>\n<li><strong>Otacon21</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fOtacon21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;—</li>\n<li><strong>patpuck</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpatpuck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;—</li>\n<li><strong>kamas55282963</strong> — <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkamas55282963\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;—</li>\n<li><strong>oni7suKa</strong> — —&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/oni7suka/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>Starlezz</strong> — —&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/starlezz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><strong>MPsantos20</strong> — —&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mpsantos20/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3410e04c261c28c37ab5a4504882383b93a43427.png\" alt=\"授權條款\"> 授權條款</h2>\n<p>這是一個<strong>非商業性質的粉絲自制附加包</strong>，完全尊重 Excalibur 的原始授權規定。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>依據 Excalibur 的授權規定：</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n  <li>不得重新發布此資源包並宣稱為自己創作。</li>\n  <li>重新發布此資源包時，必須附上本頁面的連結。</li>\n  <li>在任何情況下，都不得將此作品與任何獲利連結（如 adf.ly）綁定。</li>\n  <li>不得將此作品用於商業用途。</li>\n  <li>不得修改、轉換或基於此作品進行二次創作。</li>\n  <li>您可以將此資源包作為任何與 Minecraft 相關影片的一部分使用，包括為商業目的製作或由廣告盈利的影片。</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p><em>若您獲得 Matthew (Maffhew) Dillow 的許可，上述任何條件皆可豁免。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/asD9taD4/images/9953efb90d6bbd0330f9b74bf9dd96881994be3e.png\" alt=\"許可證明\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>更多更新即將推出……</em></p>",
